 "lines": {"carp_scrub_the_green_film_off_the_stones": ["Stone's bare. The carp will have to eat actual food.", "Scrubbed a rock for a fish that eats rocks. Circular."], "carp_sweep_the_silt_cloud_to_the_rim": ["Swept the brown out. It will be back by teatime.", "Silt in, silt out. Carp is unfazed. Carp is the reason."], "carp_rake_the_leaf_litter_off_the_deep_corner": ["Litter gone. The carp is already making more.", "Raked a pond. Pond stays unimpressed, for leaves are leaves."], "carp_groom_the_coarse_scales": ["Gritty fish. Scrubbed and still gritty.", "Scales like roof tiles. Very pleasing, very much not mine."], "carp_drop_a_handful_of_sinkers_at_the_mud_line": ["Sinkers down. Now the mud goes brown, the pond goes smug.", "Dinner is served. Cutlery at the bottom."], "carp_offer_a_pellet_at_the_mud_edge": ["Lips like a vacuum. Nearly had my bill.", "Fed a carp by hand. It sucked and judged."], "carp_trail_a_wing_along_the_mud_edge": ["Followed my wing like a dog. A very big, very wet dog.", "It nosed the bottom the whole way. Efficient, if brown."], "carp_blow_bubbles_back_at_the_carp": ["It won on volume. I won on spit.", "Bubble rally. No clear winner. Fish is warm."], "carp_test_the_mud_with_a_toe": ["Mud. Toe. Sound. Good enough as a review.", "It took my foot an inch. Mud keeps what it likes."], "carp_bow_to_the_old_carp": ["It nodded back, probably. Gills move like that.", "Bowed to a carp older than my pond. Seemed fair."], "carp_argue_with_it_about_the_mud": ["Carp says it is its mud. Carp has priors.", "Lost to a fish with a vacuum for a face."], "carp_startle_back_at_the_gulp": ["It gulped at my face. Rude, but also fair.", "Big mouth, no warning. Like a politician, scaly."], "carp_two_sets_of_sinkers_from_both_ends": ["Two dinners at once. It chose the wetter one.", "Equal pellets both ends. The carp invented a third end."]},
